# systemd-sysusers fragment.
#
# Creates the unprivileged system user the unit runs as. A sysusers fragment
# rather than a useradd call in a post-install script: it is declarative, it is
# idempotent, and systemd applies it on first boot of an image as well as on
# package installation.
#
# No home directory and no shell: the account exists to own a listening socket
# and to read three files in /etc.
u nginx-ldap-auth - "nginx LDAP authentication service" - -
